WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.717
Rachel: What are you cooking, Mom?

2
00:00:04.718 --> 00:00:07.348
Mom: I'm making applesauce.

3
00:00:07.349 --> 00:00:09.270
Ricky: Can we help?

4
00:00:09.271 --> 00:00:11.296
Mom: Sure!

5
00:00:11.297 --> 00:00:16.275
Rachel: How do you make applesauce?

6
00:00:16.276 --> 00:00:19.722
Mom: First, we peel 12 apples.

7
00:00:19.723 --> 00:00:23.141
Ricky: Twelve?

8
00:00:23.142 --> 00:00:28.962
Mom: Then, we slice the apples.

9
00:00:28.963 --> 00:00:31.826
Ricky: Can I help cut the apples?

10
00:00:31.827 --> 00:00:33.707
Rachel: Me too!

11
00:00:33.708 --> 00:00:43.875
Mom: Yes, but be careful with the knife.

12
00:00:43.876 --> 00:00:48.542
Ricky: Look, Mom! I have red hair.

13
00:00:48.543 --> 00:00:55.950
Mom: Ricky! Put the peels in the garbage.

14
00:00:55.951 --> 00:00:58.790
Rachel: Are we finished?

15
00:00:58.791 --> 00:01:09.717
Mom: Not yet. It takes thirty minutes.

16
00:01:09.718 --> 00:01:15.223
Ricky: Mmm! Smells delicious!

17
00:01:15.224 --> 00:01:27.545
Mom: Now we mix the apples and sugar.

18
00:01:27.546 --> 00:01:34.669
Rachel: It looks strange, Mom.

19
00:01:34.670 --> 00:01:39.878
Ricky: It's h-h-hot!

20
00:01:39.879 --> 00:01:47.551
Mom: Put the applesauce into the jars.

21
00:01:47.552 --> 00:01:53.910
Ricky: Making applesauce is fun.

